ons Place:**\n   \\[\n   8 + 1 + 1 (\\text{carry}) = 10 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 0, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n   \\]\n   \n10. **Billions Place:**\n    \\[\n    0 + 1 (\\text{carry}) = 1 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 1)\n    \\]\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!010,\\!018,\\!475}\n\\]. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
