 0 + 0 + 1 (\\text{carry}) = 1\n    \\]\n\nCombining all the results, we get the final sum:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!314,\\!432,\\!560}\n\\]. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
